[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5593874617","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123320#issuecomment-5593874617","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123320","id":5593874617,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTWvAuQ","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-09T00:28:35Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T00:28:44Z","body":"> When there is lots of text in a line it can still be pretty slow, so we should probably add a hard limit somewhere in the future.\r\n\r\nFor what it's worth, Kate/KWrite disable syntax highlighting for the whole file if at least one of the lines in the file exceeds 4,095 characters.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5593874617/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5603581133","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123320#issuecomment-5603581133","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123320","id":5603581133,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTf_czQ","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-09T14:31:27Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T14:35:44Z","body":"I thought the sorting was documented already, but I guess not, I found this:\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/75583\r\n\r\nThere's a couple of other issues with syntax highlighting too, I have been thinking of overhauling it in the future.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5603581133/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5604753896","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123320#issuecomment-5604753896","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123320","id":5604753896,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABThHB6A","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-09T15:53:06Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T15:53:06Z","body":"Seeing that String::operator[] is still the main culprit I wonder if it is possible to shift to getting raw pointer access to the String's Vector to avoid the CowData overhead. \r\n\r\nAlthough that is something for a follow up PR. Not a blocker for this one","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5604753896/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5622130158","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123320#issuecomment-5622130158","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123320","id":5622130158,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTxrl7g","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-10T16:38:27Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T16:38:27Z","body":"I tested this PR with a GDScript file that was just a long line of random letters, and still experienced slowdown. The profiler pointed me to `gdscript_highlighter.cpp:517` with the PR changes applied:\r\n```cpp\r\nint k = j;\r\nwhile (k < line_length && !is_symbol(str[k]) && !is_whitespace(str[k])) {\r\n\tk++;\r\n}\r\n```\r\nSince it's in the `for` loop starting on line 108, I imagine this is or around `line_length^2` iterations to go through the entire line and not find any valid GDScript to parse.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5622130158/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5622590617","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123320#issuecomment-5622590617","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123320","id":5622590617,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTyHsmQ","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-10T17:15:27Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T17:29:03Z","body":"Yeah, I saw that too when profiling. In the flame graph, its the `String::operator[]`, and the `is_symbol` and `is_whitespace` calls.\r\nWell its that line and this similar one below it:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4cefd60f5a3d733506cb557d6cd26263b3fbd17f/modules/gdscript/editor/gdscript_highlighter.cpp#L543-L545\r\n\r\nAs mentioned above https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123320#issuecomment-5604753896 , its mostly cowdata overhead.\r\nIdeally we can rework it no not need to be O(n^2) anymore, but I'm not too familiar with the highlighter logic. That way it also doesn't need to call `is_symbol` and `is_whitespace` as much. If not, it can also be changed to use raw pointer access. I think that can be done in a follow up, for now this still improves the performance especially for lines that end in lots of spaces like the issue mentioned.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5622590617/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5637474437","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123320#issuecomment-5637474437","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123320","id":5637474437,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUAUIhQ","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-11T16:26:27Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T16:26:27Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5637474437/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":5,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]